# Changes require a restart to take effect.

# Kaby Lake (gen9) can't scan out compressed (Y-tiled CCS) buffers on pipe C.
# After display wake, aquamarine can move a monitor to pipe C while keeping its
# CCS buffers, so the modeset fails and the monitor stays dark until replugged.
# Without explicit modifiers, aquamarine never allocates CCS buffers.
export AQ_NO_MODIFIERS=1
